# Graphify index scope. .gitignore is already respected (node_modules, dist,
# .venv, *.xlsx/pdf, LocalWeb/, etc. are excluded via that). This file trims
# tracked-but-not-useful-for-a-code-graph noise so semantic extraction spends
# its LLM calls on code and docs.

# Binary media (tracked under src/assets, public/, docs/, qa/)
**/*.gif
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.webp
**/*.svg
**/*.ico
**/*.ttf
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2

# Generated / vendored
package-lock.json
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css

# Data dumps, not source
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
